msgid ""
"RHS tile. rounding_mode (RoundingMode): The rounding mode for the "
"operation, only supported for float types, default is RoundingMode.RN "
"when applicable. flush_to_zero (const bool): If True, flushes subnormal "
"inputs and results to sign-preserving zero, default is False."
msgstr ""
"右操作数（RHS）Tile。 ``rounding_mode`` (RoundingMode)：该操作的舍入模式，仅支持浮点类型；适用时默认为 "
"``RoundingMode.RN`` 。 ``flush_to_zero`` (const bool)：若为 "
"True，则将次正规（subnormal）输入和结果刷零（保留符号），默认为 False。"

#: cuda.tile._stub.add:12 of
